 ## Class: `Socks5ProxyAgent`
+
+Local qualification patch: `Socks5ProxyAgent.supportsRequireAuth` is true only
+when the loaded SOCKS decoder supports strict negotiation. Stock builds have
+no such capability. Check it as well as the exact build, before isolation use.
 
